= <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#E35A5A">PSU</span> Consolidates support base 

Though the recent split of the <span style="color:#FF6961">Reformist</span> faction to form the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#E35A5A">Partito Socialista Unitario</span> as a splinter party was originally thought to be moribund, our <span style="color:#B22222">Labour</span> faction breaking with us as well has resulted in the labour union *Confederazione Generale del Lavoro* to defect to the party, as the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#E35A5A">PSU</span> seems to have consolidated and become a competitor to our party.  
